; Breakage 05: Bounded Context boundary leak!
; Tries to pass a local Udon_spec.Term.id (`@[element]`) into `:backing` which
; requires an opaque `Verisectorium.Piece.any_id` across the `.mli` boundary.
; Expected: `ocamlc` type error rejecting `Udon_spec.Term.id` for `Verisectorium.Piece.any_id`!

|document[broken-05]
  :context udon-spec
  :imports [v=verisectorium_store]

  |term[element].accepted.foundation An element node.
    :kind    full-term
    :pos     noun
    :backing @[element]
    |invariant Children stay ordered.
